# Semester-wide ignores for every course folder.
#
# This file covers what any course can produce whatever it is written
# in. Each course folder has its own .gitignore for the output of its
# own tools (Python, C, office documents).

# ─── OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─── Editor files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# ─── Obsidian ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Present only if a course folder is ever opened as its own vault.
.obsidian/
.trash/
